  m_Name: Herb_Comfrey
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Witch.Infrastructure::Witch.Infrastructure.Content.HerbDefinition
  stableId: herb.comfrey
  displayName: Comfrey
  categoryId: category.mend
  scientificName: Symphytum officinale
  treatmentText: A wide, hairy leaf and a strong root that helps mend broken bones and heal surface wounds much quicker than they would normally recover.
  warningText: It close the top layer of a deep puncture wound too quickly. Deep puncture wounds are at risk due to the rapid healing of the top layer of skin, which can lead to a lethal infection trapped inside the flesh.
